# warpinator
===
 Send and receive files across a local network.
 
 Warpinator is a free and open-source application. It allows you to easily connect to multiple computers on a local area network (LAN) and share files in a swift and secure manner.
 
 Unofficial Windows and Android versions are also available.
 
 **Android:** https://github.com/slowscript/warpinator-android
 **Windows:** https://github.com/slowscript/warpinator-windows
 
